      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on some embedded c++ code for an automotive controller and i keep hitting a memory leak issue. the heap usage just slowly climbs over a few hours of operation until the system crashes. i cant find the specific culprit in the logs. can u give me a systematic way to track down where the memory is being lost?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
